+// SoloWoW living-world simulation (adventurers, off-screen). See C:\SoloWoW\docs\DESIGN.md "Sim v1 spec".
+// Central brain, dumb bodies: every person is a row (SimAgent); bodies come later via the bot bubble.
+// v2: hunting parties, gathering professions + town markets, bounties, news that travels, trainers, rain.
+#ifndef SOLOWOW_SOLOSIM_H
+#define SOLOWOW_SOLOSIM_H
+
